Bad links are warnings, not errors. Links to other domains and to "#top" are good.

```console
$ shelf check .
! index.html:1: about goes to a folder. Add "/" at the end of the folder name.
! index.html:2: /img/logo.png starts with "/". It goes to the top of the domain, not to this Site.
! index.html:3: img/Photo.png is not in the upload. The file is img/photo.png: the case is different.
! index.html:4: img/missing.png is not in the upload.
! index.html:5: ../up.html goes above the top of the Site.
✓ 4 files, 212 bytes ([..] packed). Ready to upload.

```
